  "problem": "Maria collects stickers for a sticker album, where each sticker in the album has a different number on it.\nSo far, Maria has duplicates of the following sticker numbers:\n\n$$\n7,\\,12,\\,28,\\,35,\\,78,\\,81,\\,99,\\,112\n$$\n\nIf Maria picks a duplicate sticker at random to give to a friend, what is the probability that the sticker number she picks is greater than $70?$",
